stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending
        Pending --> Pending: sync attempt finds pending review
    Pending --> Uploading: researcher starts sync
        Uploading --> Synced: eligible detections submitted or none eligible
    Uploading --> Failed: transient failure
    Failed --> Uploading: manual retry
    FailedPermanent --> Uploading: explicit retry
        Uploading --> FailedPermanent: failure reaches retry limit
        Uploading --> Uploading: app terminates; no startup recovery
    Synced --> [*]

        note right of Synced
            May mean zero detections uploaded
        end note